{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/60e0b14409d1626b526df1b12b42fb6c.webp?t=1757948273\" width=31 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/04bccd398688ff1d3f9376a608e23abc.webp?t=1757948273\" width=57 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/2299da42d0c9497715476a52c381c7cd.webp?t=1757948273\" width=38 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/346541ab6a20a3601e63a7315db1ab22.webp?t=1757948273\" width=51 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit Amborettio, Wanech established a command post for <strong>Wanech\u2019s Z.O.O. (Zoological Outreach Operation)</strong>. The HQ hums with chiptune pings\u2014retro, cozy, and just a little heroic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down <strong>clicker-typer</strong> with arcade bursts, you\u2019ll <strong>rescue animals and grow habitats</strong>. Type the 3-letter prompts to complete rescues, <strong>click</strong> falling pickups for bonus <strong>Fish/Leaves</strong>, and <strong>trade</strong> resources into SCORE. Invest in upgrades to automate income and <strong>obtain Marine Prestige and Forest Prestige to further unlock achievements</strong>\u2014then watch your sanctuary come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody\u2019s sure why Wanech swapped dungeons for dens\u2014some say it\u2019s all to protect the creatures of Amborettio. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Z.O.O., stack upgrades, and chase a flood of achievements</strong>, with chiptunes chirping and the rescues never stopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022650?t=1757948273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022650?t=1757948273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/ef9b6525a337488313edb73e573d1fc9fc01c0e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757948273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/ef9b6525a337488313edb73e573d1fc9fc01c0e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757948273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/60e0b14409d1626b526df1b12b42fb6c.webp?t=1757948273\" width=31 height=35 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/04bccd398688ff1d3f9376a608e23abc.webp?t=1757948273\" width=57 height=33 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/2299da42d0c9497715476a52c381c7cd.webp?t=1757948273\" width=38 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/extras/346541ab6a20a3601e63a7315db1ab22.webp?t=1757948273\" width=51 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit Amborettio, Wanech established a command post for <strong>Wanech\u2019s Z.O.O. (Zoological Outreach Operation)</strong>. The HQ hums with chiptune pings\u2014retro, cozy, and just a little heroic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down <strong>clicker-typer</strong> with arcade bursts, you\u2019ll <strong>rescue animals and grow habitats</strong>. Type the 3-letter prompts to complete rescues, <strong>click</strong> falling pickups for bonus <strong>Fish/Leaves</strong>, and <strong>trade</strong> resources into SCORE. Invest in upgrades to automate income and <strong>obtain Marine Prestige and Forest Prestige to further unlock achievements</strong>\u2014then watch your sanctuary come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody\u2019s sure why Wanech swapped dungeons for dens\u2014some say it\u2019s all to protect the creatures of Amborettio. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Z.O.O., stack upgrades, and chase a flood of achievements</strong>, with chiptunes chirping and the rescues never stopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>","developers":["Wanech"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022650/663ff2e290b0c893a736f50dccf9bb001a5c72ac/header.jpg?t=1757948273","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Wanech","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195352,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195352/movie480.mp4?t=1757948108","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195352/movie_max.mp4?t=1757948108"},"name":"Wanech's Z.O.O. Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195352/3d7765958b3c8c7348e8af00907e12d7ff95bab0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757948108","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195352/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757948108","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195352/movie_max_